{%- comment -%}
  Accordion 3 tab (Envío, Pago contra reembolso, Garantía) thay cho các Collapsible rows.
  Đã BỎ tab "Preguntas frecuentes": 5 câu hỏi cũ đều lặp lại nội dung 3 tab này và khối "Cómo hacer tu pedido". (snippets/xophia-faq vẫn còn nhưng không được gọi.)
  Dùng trong block Custom Liquid của main-product: {% render 'xophia-wo-accordion' %}
  Dùng được cho MỌI sản phẩm: không có giá, tên hay handle sản phẩm gõ cứng.
  Nội dung bám đúng chính sách đã đăng (envío, devoluciones, condiciones de venta).
  Email hỗ trợ: levelupsupportteam@gmail.com (đổi cùng chỗ với xophia-footer).
  Mobile-first. Chỉ HTML/CSS/JS thuần, icon SVG nội tuyến. Màu: navy #6B2D45, kem #FBF3EF, chữ #2A1B22.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if template.suffix == 'kinh-wo' %}
<style>
.xo-acc{--xb:#6B2D45;--xg:#E2BD94;--xi:#2A1B22;--xm:#6B5A62;--xc:#FBF3EF;display:grid;gap:10px;margin:18px 0;color:var(--xi)}
.xo-acc *{box-sizing:border-box}
.xo-i{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.xo-acc__item{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(107, 45, 69,.14);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(42, 27, 34,.05);transition:border-color .3s,box-shadow .3s}
.xo-acc__item.is-open{border-color:rgba(107, 45, 69,.4);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(107, 45, 69,.1)}
.xo-acc__trigger{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;margin:0;padding:13px 14px;background:none;border:0;border-radius:16px;color:var(--xi);font:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.xo-acc__trigger:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--xb);outline-offset:2px}
.xo-acc__ico{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:38px;flex:none;border-radius:12px;background:var(--xb);color:var(--xg)}
.xo-acc__title{flex:1;min-width:0}
.xo-acc__chev{color:var(--xb);transition:transform .35s ease}
.is-open>.xo-acc__trigger .xo-acc__chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.xo-acc__panel{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr;transition:grid-template-rows .35s ease}
.xo-acc.is-ready .xo-acc__panel{grid-template-rows:0fr}
.xo-acc.is-ready .is-open>.xo-acc__panel{grid-template-rows:1fr}
.xo-acc__clip{min-height:0;overflow:hidden}
.xo-acc.is-ready .xo-acc__clip{visibility:hidden;transition:visibility 0s .35s}
.xo-acc.is-ready .is-open>.xo-acc__panel>.xo-acc__clip{visibility:visible;transition-delay:0s}
.xo-acc__body{padding:2px 16px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--xm)}
.xo-acc__body a{color:var(--xb);font-weight:600}
.xo-list{display:grid;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.xo-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:0}
.xo-list strong{color:var(--xi)}
.xo-li{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;flex:none;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(107, 45, 69,.09);color:var(--xb)}
.xo-li .xo-i{width:17px;height:17px}
.xo-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0 0 14px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(107, 45, 69,.25);border-radius:14px;background:var(--xc);color:var(--xb);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35}
.xo-badge .xo-i{width:16px;height:16px}
.xo-box{padding:14px;border:1px dashed rgba(107, 45, 69,.35);border-radius:14px;background:var(--xc)}
.xo-box__head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--xb);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700}
.xo-note{margin:12px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;border-left:3px solid var(--xb);border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;background:var(--xc);font-size:13px}
@media(min-width:750px){.xo-acc__trigger{font-size:16px}.xo-acc__body{font-size:14.5px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.xo-acc *{transition:none!important}}
</style>

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <symbol id="xo-i-truck" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 7h11v9H2z"/><path d="M13 10h4l3 3v3h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.7"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.7"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-euro" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M15.5 8.6A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 9 10.5v3a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 6.5 1.9"/><path d="M7.5 11H13M7.5 13H13"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-shield" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6l8-3z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-bolt" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7l1-8z"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-box" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 7l9-4 9 4v10l-9 4-9-4V7z"/><path d="M3 7l9 4 9-4M12 11v10"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-pin" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s7-6 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 5 7 11 7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-refresh" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-14 5.3"/><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 14-5.3"/><path d="M18 3v4h-4M6 21v-4h4"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-mail" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="xo-i-chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></symbol>
</svg>

<div class="xo-acc" id="xo-acc">

  <div class="xo-acc__item">
    <button type="button" class="xo-acc__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="xo-acc-p1">
      <span class="xo-acc__ico"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-truck"/></svg></span>
      <span class="xo-acc__title">Envío y seguimiento</span>
      <svg class="xo-i xo-acc__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-chev"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="xo-acc__panel" id="xo-acc-p1" role="region"><div class="xo-acc__clip"><div class="xo-acc__body">
      <p class="xo-badge"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-truck"/></svg><span>Mensajería urgente (GLS, Correos Express o MRW según zona)</span></p>
      <ul class="xo-list">
        <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-bolt"/></svg></span><span><strong>Confirmación en 24-72&nbsp;h:</strong> tras tu pedido te contactamos para confirmar los datos de entrega.</span></li>
        <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-box"/></svg></span><span><strong>Entrega en 3-5 días laborables:</strong> una vez confirmado, directo a tu puerta y con código de seguimiento (<em>tracking</em>).</span></li>
        <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-pin"/></svg></span><span><strong>Cobertura:</strong> envío gratis en toda la España peninsular.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="xo-note"><strong>Importante:</strong> actualmente no enviamos a las Islas Baleares, las Islas Canarias, Ceuta ni Melilla.</p>
    </div></div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="xo-acc__item">
    <button type="button" class="xo-acc__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="xo-acc-p2">
      <span class="xo-acc__ico"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-euro"/></svg></span>
      <span class="xo-acc__title">Pago contra reembolso</span>
      <svg class="xo-i xo-acc__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-chev"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="xo-acc__panel" id="xo-acc-p2" role="region"><div class="xo-acc__clip"><div class="xo-acc__body">
      <div class="xo-box">
        <p class="xo-box__head"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-shield"/></svg>Compra sin riesgos</p>
        <ul class="xo-list">
          <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-check"/></svg></span><span><strong>Cero pagos por adelantado:</strong> no necesitas tarjeta de crédito ni compartir datos bancarios.</span></li>
          <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-check"/></svg></span><span><strong>Sin tasas ocultas:</strong> el precio que ves es el precio final. El pago contra reembolso es totalmente gratis.</span></li>
          <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-check"/></svg></span><span><strong>Paga en efectivo al repartidor:</strong> entrega el importe exacto al mensajero cuando recibas el paquete en tus manos.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div></div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="xo-acc__item">
    <button type="button" class="xo-acc__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="xo-acc-p3">
      <span class="xo-acc__ico"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-shield"/></svg></span>
      <span class="xo-acc__title">Garantía de 30 días y soporte</span>
      <svg class="xo-i xo-acc__chev" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-chev"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="xo-acc__panel" id="xo-acc-p3" role="region"><div class="xo-acc__clip"><div class="xo-acc__body">
      <ul class="xo-list">
        <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-refresh"/></svg></span><span><strong>30 días de prueba sin compromiso:</strong> si el producto no cumple tus expectativas, tienes 30 días naturales para solicitar el cambio o el reembolso.</span></li>
        <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-mail"/></svg></span><span><strong>Atención por email:</strong> escríbenos a <a href="mailto:levelupsupportteam@gmail.com">levelupsupportteam@gmail.com</a> indicando tu número de pedido y respondemos en un plazo máximo de 48 horas laborables.</span></li>
        <li><span class="xo-li"><svg class="xo-i" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#xo-i-lock"/></svg></span><span><strong>Defectos de fábrica:</strong> si el producto llega defectuoso, te enviamos una unidad nueva gratis.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="xo-note">Incluye tu derecho legal de desistimiento de 14 días.</p>
    </div></div></div>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
(function () {
  var root = document.getElementById('xo-acc');
  if (!root || root.dataset.ready) return;
  root.dataset.ready = '1';
  root.classList.add('is-ready');
  root.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
    var trigger = event.target.closest('.xo-acc__trigger');
    if (!trigger || !root.contains(trigger)) return;
    var item = trigger.closest('.xo-acc__item');
    var open = item.classList.toggle('is-open');
    trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
  });
})();
</script>
{% endif %}
